  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the National Endowment for Democracys Center for International Private Enterprise (NED/CIPE) development program for the Papua New Guinea Womens Chamber of Commerce. The goals is to poormote the development, sustainability and advocacy skills of the nascent Papua New Guinea Womens Chamber of Commerce. Activities will be aimed at accomplishing APEC&apos;s cross-cutting goals of empowering women entrepreneurs; strengthening womens voices in public policymaking through independent, self-sustaining and politically influential business associations; and strengthening women small business owners&apos; access to international networks and markets. .</narrative>
  </description>
